OL,3,GNEWSAJail for 80mph driver who killed
OL,4,Aman on seafront
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who hit and killed a
OL,7,Fpedestrian while doing 80mph in a 30mph
OL,8,Flimit has been jailed for six years.
OL,10,FZack Garrido, 25, was at the wheel of a
OL,11,FTesla Model 3 on South Beach Parade,
OL,12,FGreat Yarmouth, when he hit 39-year-old
OL,13,FPaul Leavy, who was crossing the road.
OL,15,FNorfolk Police said subsequent
OL,16,Finvestigations showed Garrido, of Mill
OL,17,FRoad, Burgh Castle, had been doing up
OL,18,Fto 80mph before the incident, which
OL,19,Fhappened at about 21:45 BST on 27
OL,20,FAugust 2024.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
