OL,3,GNEWSAJail for 80mph driver who killed
OL,4,Aman on seafront
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe had admitted causing death by
OL,7,Fdangerous driving and, at a sentencing
OL,8,Fhearing on Monday at Norwich Crown
OL,9,FCourt, he was given a six-year prison
OL,10,Fsentence and was disqualified from
OL,11,Fdriving for eight years.
